    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A detached three-bedroom cottage situated approximately 6km from Ardfert village and just 10km from the picturesque coastal village of Ballyheigue, with Banna Strand also close by. While requiring modernisation throughout, the property with its 0.7 acre site offers excellent space and potential, making it an ideal family home or renovation project.\r\nThe accommodation comprises three bedrooms, two living rooms, a kitchen/dining area and a generously sized family bathroom. The property also features a substantial rear garden and a farm outbuilding, providing excellent storage or potential for a variety of uses. Ardfert offers a range of local amenities including shops, schools and cafes. With its convenient location, generous accommodation and ample outdoor space, this property offers an excellent opportunity to create a comfortable family home in a peaceful rural setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance - 4.3m x 2.3m \r\nLino flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen - 5.8m x 3.2m \r\nFitted kitchen with ground and eye level units, lino flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.5m x 3.4m \r\nFitted cupboards, carpeted floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room 2 - 4.6m x 3.1m \r\nOpen fireplace, fitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.5m x 2.0m \r\nLino flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.6m x 3.0m \r\nLino flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.5m x 2.0m \r\nLino flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom - 4.8m x 2.3m \r\nWHB,WC, shower, bath, lino flooring\r\n\r\n"
      },
